# treadle 1
type Program class
	namespace M3Files
	static
	doc "Milestone 3, files: counts the words of the command line (or of a built-in sentence when there are none) through a Queue, keeps their first-seen order with a HashSet, writes the counts to m3-files-out/counts.txt, reads the file back line by line, lists the folder, then removes both."

function m0001 Main
	static
	returns int
	doc "Words into a Queue<StringView>; each one taken off the queue is counted in a Dictionary and, the first time a HashSet sees it, added to the order list. The report goes to a file through File.WriteAllText and comes back through File.ReadLines; Directory.GetFiles lists the folder."
param args String[]
